+    calls at capture (before entering the capture region), before every replay, and nowhere else —
+    FlashInferAttnBackend keeps an independent eager body in `init_forward_metadata`. So this
+    installs one hook on each and mirrors sglang's own split: eager forwards get a plain wrapper,
+    captured batch sizes each get a cuda-graph-mode wrapper bound to fixed index buffers.
